  <programme start="20260906150500 +0000" stop="20260906160500 +0000" channel="unknown.unifitv">
    <title lang="en">Sunshine Heartbeat</title>
    <desc lang="en">They are young. They are bold. They sweat. They fall in love - on the beach. YIP CHING (YEO VIVIEN), YIP KIU (LI SZE YAN) and YIP YAN (CHEN CHI YIU) are sisters. When they were young, they met a Gypsy girl (YUNG CHO YEE, JOEY) who foresaw that CHING would meet her true love, who has a four-leafed clover birthmark, when she turns eighteen. In the blink of an eye, the sisters have grown up and are now sixth-formers at the Greenwood International School. The beach volleyball team captain YUE YAT SUN (SZETO SHUI KI), a star student, is handsome and cheerful. Many girls join the team just for him. The sisters see a four-leafed clover birthmark which matches the description given by the Gypsy girl on SUN from three different angles. However, CHING is indecisive and lacks confidence. KIU and YAN are busy trying to set up chances for her to be with SUN. The three sisters join the beach volleyball team. Remarkably, they also find the same birthmark on a bad student named NIC FONG (CHoi KAY CHUN). The sisters are confused, unsure about who is CHING's true love…</desc>
    <category lang="en">Drama Series</category>
    <episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.10.</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="onscreen">S1E11</episode-num>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260906160500 +0000" stop="20260906170500 +0000" channel="unknown.unifitv">
    <title lang="en">Gilded Chopsticks</title>
    <desc lang="en">Ever since his childhood, KO TIN-PO (Wong Cho Lam) has tasted a variety of great delicacies, and he is capable of analyzing the food quality and authenticity once he tastes it. But, owing to the decline of his family, he ends up wandering on the street with his servant LEE WAI (Jack Wu), making a living from selling buns. Also due to his gourmet background, he gets to know a street performer KEI MO-SUET (Joey Meng), the most beautiful girl in Peking NIAN RUOBI (Nancy Wu) and teen celebrity chef MAI SIU-YU (Stephanie Ho), etc. As fate would have it, he comes across Prince YINZHEN (Ben Wong), who is making a tour in disguise, and the two share similar interests. Later on, he is recommended for an imperial chef in the palace, where he runs into his archrival CHOI HOK-TING (Bob Lam), resulting in consecutive fierce battles between them. Meanwhile, TIN-PO has no idea he has been caught in the plot that Prince YINSI (Louis Cheung) hatches to become the rightful heir to the throne. Under such disadvantage, TIN-PO becomes the man who brings luck to Prince YINZHEN, continuously turning the tide for him before his defeat. However, an unexpected betrothal brings him down from the lofty position to the most inferior one of a stray dog......</desc>
    <category lang="en">Drama Series</category>
    <episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.17.</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="onscreen">S1E18</episode-num>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260906170500 +0000" stop="20260906180500 +0000" channel="unknown.unifitv">
    <title lang="en">Love As A Predatory Affair</title>
    <desc lang="en">Food supplier LO KAI-FONG (Kitty Yuen) is a short, average, thirtysomething dating virgin, and she serendipitously helps a young restaurateur, LAU PAK-YIP (Jason Chan), overcome adversity, making this drop-dead gorgeous uncover and value her inner beauty. Gradually, their love grows, which KAI-FONG's neighbour and best friend, KO KWAI-FUN (Samantha Ko), cannot let go of. Though fish peddler KWAI-FUN, whose beauty resembles a stunning diva, tries every means possible to flirt with PAK-YIP, she still cannot create any chemistry with him. Unexpectedly, HUNG SIN (King Kong), heir to a Taiwanese Tan-Tsu noodles business, begins to take a fancy to KWAI-FUN, and he even roughs it in the subdivided flat together with KAI-FONG and the others so as to get to know KWAI-FUN better. Since KWAI-FUN's effort goes unnoticed by PAK-YIP, she shifts her focus to court his uncle, LAU LEI-KO (Timothy Cheng). Later on, facing growing negative criticism over his girlfriend KAI-FONG, PAK-YIP cannot bear it anymore, which eventually sours his relationship with KAI-FONG. When there's no such thing as unconditional love, and the line between good and bad becomes blurred, love transforms to a predatory affair, catapulting everyone, both male and female, to the brink of war......</desc>
    <category lang="en">Drama Series</category>
    <episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="onscreen">S1E2</episode-num>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260906180500 +0000" stop="20260906190500 +0000" channel="unknown.unifitv">
    <title lang="en">ICAC Investigators 2022</title>
    <desc lang="en">Rewind ten years and Tong Wai-chung (Benjamin Yuen) and Shum O-ming (Shuan Tam) join ICAC at the same time. The duo become brotherly buddies as they undergo training together. O-ming is injured as he carries out some arbitrary operation. He then tenders his resignation, and no one has heard from him ever since. Fast forward ten years and Wai-chung is promoted to Chief Investigator. Wai-chung and his subordinates, including Lee Chun-yee (Sisley Choi) and Shorty (Hera Chan), are committed to maintaining probity and righteousness. While investigating a suspected bank staff corruption case, Wai-chung realizes O-ming is surprisingly implicated. Actually, O-ming uses investigation experience he gained at ICAC to assist some crime syndicate in repeatedly foiling criminal and anti-corruption investigation activities in different regions. Wai-chung is saddened by his buddy forgetting the original aim was to defend fairness and righteousness when they joined ICAC. He is determined to bring the crime syndicate to justice!</desc>
    <category lang="en">Drama Series</category>
    <episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.</episode-num>
    <episode-num system="onscreen">S1E4</episode-num>
  </programme>
